  "method": [
    "Original retained ROM instructions execute in the pinned Genesis Plus GX 68000 core in a fresh process. Capstone supplies trace instruction lengths; the original CPU core executes instruction semantics.",
    "Cases seed bounded work RAM and registers, mask interrupts in supervisor mode, and terminate on a controlled return. Native RAM changes are restricted to named watches and explicit stack scratch.",
    "The reviewed source translation is parsed into typed, data-only UIL. GameMachine executes that UIL. The final replay checks that the authoring source and interpreter hashes remain unchanged before and after all 1,262 cases.",
    "For the orange orb AI, an observer forwards the original hardware read16 callback unchanged and records 192 actual VDP HV returns. UIL replays the same finite environmental inputs in the same order.",
    "Original render-only RaftList and NumRafts writes are watched but excluded from the logical-state equality predicate.",
    "A full object pool is outside the native comparison domain: original AddObject scans beyond its 48 slots. The bounded profile sets actor_capacity_fault and returns 255; acceptance must reject that flag. Normal source populations start at no more than 28, and only a short-lived spring effect allocates extra slots.",
    "After the two narrow cost changes, all 1,262 original CPU cases were re-executed in fresh workers with unchanged input contracts. Baseline and optimized typed UIL programs each replay the same fresh outputs and captured environmental samples."
  ],
